~ start
Fenn: [speed=0.8]Uh... Az?[/speed]
Az: What's wrong?
Fenn: There's a big wall of ice in front of the door again.
Az: Okay, where are you?[wait=0.2] [i]cough[/i].[wait=0.2] What does the room look like?
Fenn: It's... [wait=0.2]like a big room with plants and books and stuff.
Az: That must be the door to my [color="blue"]Workshop[/color].
Wizard: [font_size=70][wave freq=10 amp=30]Thou shalt never reach me whilst I am in here![/wave][/font_size]
Az: You turned off the heater, [wait=0.2]didn't you?
Wizard: [font_size=80][shake level=10 rate=30]WHAT? HOW DIDST THOU KNOWETH THIS?[/shake][/font_size]
Az: I dunno, [wait=0.2]maybe it's because you're in [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=30]MY [color="blue"]WORKSHOP[/color].[/shake][/font_size]
Wizard: Ah... [wait=0.2][font_size=40]thou art correct...[/font_size][font_size=30] [wait=0.2]my bad.[/font_size]
Az: [i]sigh[/i]. Fenn, there should a grate out of the Den. You might be able to get to the heater from there. Think you could turn it on?
Fenn: Oooh yay! [wave freq=7 amp=30]A new page in the hero's journey-eth![/wave]
Az: Kid, [wait=0.2]if you start talking like that too, [wait=0.2]I might just go crazy.
Wizard: [font_size=60]NO! [/font_size]Whatever thou art planning,[wait=0.2] [font_size=40]um,[/font_size][wait=0.2] [font_size=30]stop that right now.[/font_size]
Az: Hey [shake level=7 rate=20][i]Wizard boy[/i].[/shake][wait=0.2] You touch anything in there, I'll make sure it's [shake level=7 rate=30]the last thing you do[/shake],[wait=0.2] you hear me?
Winston: Um. [wait=0.2][font_size=35]Ahem.[/font_size] [wait=0.2]No promises.
Az: I [i]swear[/i]- [wait=0.2]ugh, [wait=0.2]Fenn, I'll be there as soon as I can.
Fenn: Okay-eth!
do EventFlags.set_flag("AzWs-Arrive-Den", true)

